# The whole .agent-guard store travels with the repo (owner decision
# 2026-11-10: "these are not tracked I think it is wrong, since everyone has a
# preference"). contract.json, config.json, state.json, journal.jsonl,
# events*.jsonl and verify_runs.jsonl are the record of what was asked and what
# was proved, so a clone starts from the same intent and the same evidence.
# Only live lock artifacts are machine state, never intent.
.agent-guard/*.lock
.venv/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
dist/
build/
docs/issues
.pypi-token/